bluejetty:00046941:ios.description:
Keep Your Home Clean & Organized with Ease!
Our Chores Tracker & Cleaning Schedule app helps you stay on top of household tasks effortlessly. Whether you’re managing daily cleaning, weekly deep cleans, or shared household responsibilities, this app makes it simple to create, assign, and track chores — so your home stays spotless with minimal effort!
With our app, you'll experience a more organized household by:
- Keep track of all chores in one place;
- Fairly distributing chores to household members;
- Never forget an important task;
- Creating sustainable cleaning routines that fit your schedule;
- Track progress and cultivate positive habits;
- Reduce clutter and keep every room tidy.
Enjoy powerful features designed to simplify home cleaning:
- Customizable Chore Lists – Create tasks that fit your cleaning routine;
- Recurring Tasks – Automate daily, weekly, monthly or yearly chores;
- Shared Access – Sync tasks with family or roommates;
- Smart Reminders – Get notified when it’s time to clean;
- Vacation Mode – Pause tasks when you’re away;
- Task History – Track completed chores to stay motivated;
- Pre-made Checklists – Access a collection of ready-to-use cleaning checklists;
- Chores Chart – A visual overview of assigned tasks for easy tracking.
Download now and take control of your cleaning schedule. Keep your home fresh, tidy, and stress-free — effortlessly!
--------------------
We respect your privacy — your data stays safe with us. Check out our Privacy Policy ( https://cleaning-schedule.com/privacy ) and Terms of Use ( https://cleaning-schedule.com/terms ) for details.
Got questions? We’re happy to help! Reach out anytime at support@cleaning-schedule.com.

